Reads payments in the current mode. Live keys read live payments.

Usage:
  reevit payments [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List recent payments (current mode)

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for payments

Global Flags:
      --json       print machine-readable JSON to stdout
      --no-color   disable colour and glyphs
  -q, --quiet      suppress progress and hints; errors still print

Use "reevit payments [command] --help" for more information about a command.
